OL,3,AAnthropic shares fall a day after
OL,4,Ablockbuster opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic's share price has dropped
OL,7,Fback towards its initial public
OL,8,Foffering (IPO) price, after a soaring
OL,9,Fmarket debut, as the broader tech sell
OL,10,Foff continues.
OL,12,FThe artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,13,Fcompany's debut on the Nasdaq stock
OL,14,Fexchange on Thursday was a crucial test
OL,15,Ffor the industry, and was largely seen
OL,16,Fas a success with trading starting at
OL,17,F$111.50.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
