OL,3,AAnthropic shares fall a day after
OL,4,Ablockbuster opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Anthropic's shares opened
OL,7,Ftrading on Friday down 8% at about $88,
OL,8,Fclose to its IPO price of $83, and the
OL,9,Fbroader stock market falls seen on
OL,10,FThursday continued.
OL,12,FThe tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite Index
OL,13,Fopening down 1.3%. The S&P 500 also
OL,14,Fopened down 0.4% while the Dow Jones
OL,15,FIndustrial Average opened largely flat.
